# A HETEROGENEOUS source arm: an Observation concept whose representation is a DIFFERENT resource type.
library "Heterogeneous Source".

terminology "Covered Services VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/heterogeneous-source/ValueSet/covered-services`.

concept "Requested Service":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- code is `requested-service`.
- definition is most recent this.
- source representation:
  - type is ServiceRequest.
  - coded from "Covered Services VS".

concept "Service Was Requested":
- shape is Scalar.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `service-was-requested`.
- defined as exists ("Requested Service").

activity "Approve":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `APPROVED`.

activity "Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `NOT APPROVED`.

decision "Requested Service Decision":
first:
- when "Service Was Requested" then recommend activity "Approve".
- otherwise then recommend activity "Deny".
